K_POINTS
0
Gamma
8 8 8 0 0 0
// Format: Nx Ny Nz  shift_x shift_y shift_z
// shift 0 0 0 = Gamma-centered Monkhorst-Pack grid
// shift 1 1 1 = offset grid (may avoid Gamma point)
//
// 8x8x8 is safe for most systems (metals and insulators).
// Large supercells: reduce to 2x2x2 or 1x1x1 (Gamma-only).
// Slabs: use 1 in vacuum direction (e.g. 8 8 1 0 0 0).
